							<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=763" title="View the profile of JulieC">JulieC</a></b>
							<div class="smalltext">
								Newbie<br />
								<img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
